ontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0CQZ_CU4p1Ugpx3J2tuNb5UlCsBZoYX99z0-zWTOwBMQ&oe=69F0A8E9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "578771310204084", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75250461_578771313537417_7264947156966248962_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lQINKcSNbpIQ7kNvwGDA2hc&_nc_oc=Adp2aog3ZHOaFE6f6uyZJ5nhwwqXJAzxCWlX5a4JDclNzOkiBspCBeqDfeC7TkCnKwc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3MDiXKXmc8zZlQOo4xgXPLUj-tLklKi_-PyikQRN-Z7w&oe=69F0C6C6"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "560857161823835", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569472_560857165157168_728140567734174966_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uccLONF0c9EQ7kNvwEXsyqT&_nc_oc=AdotD1qiwDv-fnWd-EmkNEPIxEaeymYAveBcD9fJ2ifdEgqEYGK42txK04ac2_r_zr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2zGWJHod1fpvTzC390gicrDyjwApo1YTf_e8fJJCB8tQ&oe=69F09F6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Arabian Heroes", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Let's ruffle some feathers!\n\nIn the beautiful Arabic desert one day everything changed \u2013 an evil sorcerer released his corrupted crows to invade the planet. Hopefully, the Arabian Heroes family is there to protect and have an unlimited supply of jelly to shoot the crows. But they are coming from everywhere and are harder to defeat!\nUntil now the Arabian Heroes receive help from their friends the white crows, who bring them coins to help in upgrading with accessories and make them stronger. \nThe Arabian Heroes travel the worlds that are about to be destroyed. Although they fight hard, they need more people to join them. They won\u2019t stand for long!\n\nJoin the Arabian Heroes in their battle to save the planet! \n", "short_description": "In the beautiful Arabic desert one day everything changed \u2013 an evil sorcerer released his corrupted crows to invade the planet. Hopefully, the Arabian Heroes family is there to protect